  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EasySteel/BH_S_HEADER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"424\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#000080\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EasySteel/BH_S_BANNER1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"></strong></span><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#333\"><strong>Easy Steel &amp; More 專為原版+玩法設計，尊重鑽石/獄髓的頂級地位，同時為玩家提供工具、武器和盔甲的額外選擇。在石材與鑽石之間提供更完整的材料體系。還提供特殊工具組用於砍伐樹木、3x3採礦和3x3挖掘。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fclients%252faff.php%253faff%253d3271\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#333\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EasySteel/BH_S_PROMO.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"283\"></strong></span></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#333\"><strong><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EasySteel/BH_S_BANNER2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 在世界生成中新增 (3) 種礦石（錫石、金紅石、黑鎢礦）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 破碎鎚用於基礎礦石翻倍與製作粉末</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 燧石 - 由鋒利燧石製成</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 青銅 - 由銅和錫製成</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 鋼 - 由鐵和碳製成</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 鈦合金 - 由鈦和碳製成</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 硬化鋼 - 由鋼和更多碳製成</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 碳化鎢 - 由鎢和碳製成</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 原版風格工具：劍、鎬、斧、鏟、鋤、弓和弩</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 挖掘鏟 - 3x3範圍的鏟</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 大鎚 - 3x3範圍的鎬</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 多功能鎬 - 結合斧、鏟和鎬的功能</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\">- 伐木斧 - 可砍伐整棵樹木</span><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><br><em>** 材料和工具數值可透過設定檔依喜好調整</em></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"color:#36f;font-size:24px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/117/screen-shot-2021-12-02-at-12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"885\" height=\"737\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/424/14/screen-shot-2022-01-20-at-12.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"338\" height=\"421\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">破碎鎚將是重要工具！在合成台中對原版與Easy Steel礦石使用可獲得(2)份礦石粉末。適用於煤、鐵、金、鑽石、綠寶石、銅、錫、鈦和鎢。若其他模組的礦石方塊具有正確的Forge礦石標籤，亦適用此機制。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/266/957/screen-shot-2019-10-26-at-11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"307\" height=\"336\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>使用粉末或錠製作鋼材，任君選擇：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/442/screen-shot-2020-03-11-at-11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"366\" height=\"178\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/281/453/screen-shot-2020-03-11-at-11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"367\" height=\"176\"></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>使用方式：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 新增四種世界生成礦石：<strong>錫石</strong>（錫）、<strong>金紅石</strong>（鈦）、<strong>黑鎢礦</strong>（鎢）；<strong>可於設定檔中停用礦石生成</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 碳可透過在合成台用破碎鎚處理煤炭/木炭獲得</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 青銅需在合成台混合銅粉與錫粉（3:1）後，將生青銅放入普通熔爐燒煉</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 鋼需在合成台混合碳粉與鐵粉後，將生鋼放入高爐燒煉</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 鈦合金需在合成台混合碳粉與鈦粉後，將生鈦合金放入高爐燒煉</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 硬化鋼需在合成台混合生鋼與碳粉後，將生硬化鋼放入高爐燒煉</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 碳化鎢需在合成台混合鎢粉與碳粉後，將生碳化鎢放入高爐燒煉</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 破碎鎚可對銅、錫、鎢、鐵、金、鑽石和綠寶石實現礦石翻倍</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>小技巧：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 建議起始於有裸露岩石的生態域，礦石可能暴露於地表</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 使用手鏟收集鋒利燧石製作燧石工具。對砂礫方塊使用，隨機獲得燧石或鋒利燧石</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 碳粉可透過用破碎鎚合成煤炭獲得</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">- 鐵粒可合成鐵環，用於製作原版鎖鏈盔甲</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/276/777/screen-shot-2020-01-26-at-10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1566\" height=\"455\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/276/91/screen-shot-2020-01-18-at-11.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"237\"><br><a href=\"https://discord.gg/j7bYbkW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/EasySteel/BH_S_BANNER3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1680\" height=\"212\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
